    "summary": "\"Ten cross-slug links were written\" is a hand-typed count that undercounts the links the same paragraph describes.",
    "failure_scenario": "The four new sources hold 12 non-primary slug links, not ten: REF-00977 → 3 (accessible-design-failures-poor-performance, mobility-built-environment, threshold-and-level-access), REF-00999 → 4, REF-01000 → 3, REF-01001 → 2. Ten is the count of link-source-slug calls in the first pass only; the sentence then names all four sources including REF-01001, whose two cross-links were written later. The attestation repeats the figure (\"seven of the ten cross-slug links\"). Rule 7a: derive it or write the command beside it — this document's own header says \"Derive every figure below rather than trusting it\" and then does not."
  },
  {
    "file": "scratchpad/batch-14-co2-professional-bodies/commands.jsonl",
